[l_english.STATE_LORE_388]
The spires of Wonderbolts Academy were once the closest place to the Sun of Equestria — both literally and metaphorically. This military academy, suspended above the clouds, used the dawn light reflected off its gilded dome as training signals, branding Celestia’s royal crest upon the proud chests of every graduate. Until a group of dropouts, seizing the moment, ordered its closure. The academy was forced to cease admissions, and its graduates could only seek new homes among the cloudborne cities — some flew to Canterlot, some became residents of Stratusburg, while others fell beneath the clouds in their futile defense of the academy.
After Lord Derpy took power, Wonderbolts Academy underwent a complete transformation. Rusted training equipment was carefully wrapped in muffin-themed bandages to prevent tourist injuries; obstacle courses were lined with grinning strawberry muffin plushies; the once-precise storm control system, which required thirty pegasi to operate, was retrofitted into a giant oven, now emitting the caramelized scent of blueberry filling instead of storm warnings. Old instructors still hear the sharp whistle of wings cutting through the midnight air, but when they open the windows, all they see are night-shift bakers kneading dough into the clouds.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_388]
闪电天马学院的塔尖曾是小马利亚离太阳最近的地方—从物理意义和比喻意义上都是如此。这座悬浮在云层之上的军事学院，用镀金穹顶反射的晨光作为训练信号，把塞拉斯蒂娅的皇家徽章烙在每个毕业生骄傲挺起的胸膛上。直到一众肄业生借着时局下令将这里关闭，闪电天马学院才被迫停止了招生，而那些毕业生们也只能在云层之上的城市中寻找新的归宿：有的飞向了坎特洛特，有的成为了层云堡的居民，有的则在保卫学院的过程中跌落到了云层之下。
呆蹄领主继位之后，闪电天马学院则完全变了一个风格。那些生锈的训练器材，都被用马芬创可贴好好地包裹起来，避免划伤游客；障碍跑道两侧立着咧嘴傻笑的草莓马芬玩偶；当年需要三十匹飞马协同操作的高精雷暴控制设备，现在被改装成了巨型烤箱，飘出来的不再是暴雨预警，而是蓝莓馅料的焦香。仍有老教官在午夜听见翅膀划破空气的尖啸，但推开窗户只看见夜班厨师在往云朵里揉面团。
